# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform.
# The server parses its own text at runtime — rule and skill frontmatter, listings,
# fixtures — and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf handed those parsers CRLF
# (PR #23: no project rule parsed, so none ever fired).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Media and binaries are never touched. Listed rather than left to detection: a small
# PRG with no NUL byte in it would otherwise be taken for text and its $0D $0A pairs
# rewritten.
*.prg binary
*.bin binary
*.o binary
*.d64 binary
*.d71 binary
*.d81 binary
*.g64 binary
*.p64 binary
*.crt binary
*.t64 binary
*.tap binary
*.reu binary
*.sid binary
*.vsf binary
*.c64re binary
*.c64retrace binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.sqlite binary
*.duckdb binary
